   * time series of C where A = a1 and B = b1 or b2<br>**filter=A eq ‘a1’ and B eq
   * ‘b1’ or B eq ‘b2’ and C eq ‘*’**<br>- Invalid variant:<br>**filter=A eq ‘a1’
   * and B eq ‘b1’ and C eq ‘*’ or B = ‘b2’**<br>This is invalid because the logical
